      "independent": true,
      "snippet": "MacRumors launch coverage (Nov 9, 2023): Humane unveiled the Ai Pin, $700, with a $24/month subscription on the Humane network (T-Mobile). Orders begin in the US on November 16. Laser projector ('Laser Ink Display') projects onto the user's hand; 13MP ultra-wide camera; Snapdragon chip; magnetic battery-swap system ('perpetual power'). No battery life per charge is given anywhere in the coverage. All capability claims are Humane's own, relayed by the outlet; no independent hands-on."
