      "snippet": "Humane's own launch press release: calls the Ai Pin 'the first wearable device and software platform built to harness the full power of AI'. Claims Laser Ink Display, Ai Mic with Cosmos/Ai Bus routing every request through AI with no apps, and a perpetual power system with hot-swappable battery boosters. Complete system $699, orders Nov 16, ships early 2024. Every claim in this source is the company's own marketing."
