      "snippet": "EssilorLuxottica / Meta press release: Ray-Ban Meta smart glasses — announced Sep 27, 2023, in stores Oct 17, 2023, starting at $299. AI wearable with camera, Meta AI voice assistant and open-ear audio, phone-paired. On sale to reviewers six weeks before the Ai Pin's announcement."
